{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はAKB48の全国ツアーでした〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in滋賀！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たなみんさんの地元"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/20/6295425/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハにスケジュールの関係で、あまり出れなくて、チームBのみんなとあわせてちゃんと自分の中で自信を持てずにいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもメンバーが沢山助けてくれて、練習も付き合ってくれて。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと協力してステージを作る大切さや楽しさを学びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の優しさにふれ一人ホテルの部屋で号泣笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二回公演で、どっちも緊張しまくったな〜｡ﾟ(ﾟ^o^ﾟ)ﾟ｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンを歌わせてもらいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターで、しかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆきりんに両脇を固めてもらいました三└(┐卍^o^)卍ﾄﾞｩﾙﾙﾙﾙ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは一生の思い出です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃ緊張した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/20/6295425/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかった！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴重な体験！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニットは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投げキッスで撃ち落とせ\n走れペンギンをやらせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもセンターで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなダンス上手くてついていくのに必死な生駒ちゃんでした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はみんなともっと楽しんで歌って踊りたい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで学んだことを乃木坂46に帰ってどう生かそうかなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱりLIVE楽しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番自分にあってる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/20/6295425/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってもいいですかね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/20/6295425/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームB♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を動かしているのはヤル気だけだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/20/6295425/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}